      "trackName": "Cyber Ball: Watch Runner",
      "description": "IGNITE THE NEON RUSH.\n\nCyber Ball is a high-speed 3D platformer built exclusively for Apple Watch.\n\nForget simple 2D games. Push your Series/Ultra to the limit with true 3D physics, and smooth fps action.\n\nCONTROLS:\n• Digital Crown Precision: Rotate the crown for precise control.\n• Gravity Flip: Ride magnetic inverted tracks and loop-the-loops.\n\nGAMEPLAY FEATURES:\n• Synthwave Esthetic: Race through a retro-futuristic void.\n• Ring Tunnels: Thread the needle through floating rings for bonuses.\n• Skill-Based: No auto-play here. You need reflexes to survive.\n• Haptic Immersion: Feel every steer.\n• Quick Sessions: Perfect for 30-60 second bursts.\n\nCan you conquer the void?",
